==Restrictions==
Rarity: Only [[:Category:Special Cats|Special]] and [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]]

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 216.67 seconds<sup>6,500f</sup>, delay 320 seconds<sup>9,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 323.33 seconds<sup>9,700f</sup>, delay 320 seconds<sup>9,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 270 seconds<sup>8,100f</sup>, delay 320 seconds<sup>9,600f</sup>.
